 "check": {
  "describe": "Phone: 'Aura One' and $349 at the top, dark (Midnight) headphones on a pale turntable disc, the band's ends straight over the aluminium yokes, the cups solid domes, a card below with 'Colour Midnight', four swatches (the first ringed) and an Explode view button. Exploded: the band lifts, cups move out, cushions in, yokes and sliders up in line under the band's ends, the dark 40 mm drivers between cups and cushions; five labelled leader lines (Headband, Foam cushion, 40 mm driver, Aluminium yoke, Ear cup) on the nearer cup, and the button says Assemble. A swatch tap recolours shell and cushions. Tablet: model left, a side panel with title, price, colour, swatches, button, four specs and a sentence. Mono dark / mono light: the headphones as white (black) hidden-line wireframes with no turntable, outlined colour circles with the chosen one filled, the Button in its mono face, cards outlined.",
